Subject: [PATCH] Feature: filter todos by status (Fixes #4)

- Add done query parameter to GET /todos endpoint
- Filter applies before pagination so total reflects filtered count
- Reject invalid done values with 400
- Update README endpoints table
- Add tests for done=true, done=false, and invalid value
